@startuml

salt
{
  <b>TENANT SETTINGS: ACME BANK</b>
  --
  {#
    Tenant details | Value
    Code | acme
    Name | Acme Bank
    Hostname | acme.example.com
    Type | organisation
    Current status | active
  }
  --
  <b>END A TENANT'S LIFE - CHOOSE ONE OPERATION</b>
  --
  {#
    Operation | What happens | Reachable today
    Suspend | Sign-in stops. No data is deleted. | SQL only
    Terminate | All data is kept. The tenant can no longer be used. | SQL only
    Deprovision | Every session ends. All tenant data is hidden. | SQL only
    Purge | Every row is deleted, the tenant included. Cannot be undone. | SQL only
    Reset tenant | The tenant returns to bootstrapping. | iam.v1.system.reset-tenant
    Reset system | Every non-system tenant is purged. Cannot be undone. | iam.v1.system.reset
  }
  --
  <b>CONFIRMATION - ACME BANK (acme)</b>
  Every account inside acme loses access at once.
  This operation cannot be undone.
  --
  <b>Type the tenant code to confirm:</b>
  {#
    Tenant code | ____________
  }
  --
  [ Cancel ] | [ Retire acme ]
}

@enduml
